00:40:33.619 --> 00:40:37.619
seeing the kryptonian symbol for doom in her mind.

00:40:37.619 --> 00:40:41.619
The symbol for doom represents the ultimate destroyer.

00:40:41.619 --> 00:40:45.619
A cryptonian creature bred for a single purpose,

00:40:45.619 --> 00:40:47.619
to kill.

00:40:47.619 --> 00:40:50.619
It adapts and evolves to any attack.

00:40:50.619 --> 00:40:53.619
It is virtually unstoppable.

00:40:53.619 --> 00:40:58.619
And it appears it's made its way to Earth.

00:40:58.619 --> 00:41:02.619
The brainiac was trying to contact this thing using Chloe's a vessel.

00:41:02.619 --> 00:41:03.619
If there's a vessel.

00:41:03.619 --> 00:41:07.619
It is true, and it is likely the creature will find her soon.

00:41:07.619 --> 00:41:10.619
I don't care how powerful it is.

00:41:10.619 --> 00:41:13.619
I'll take it on like I have everything else.

00:41:13.619 --> 00:41:17.280
I am here for you as well, my son.

00:41:17.280 --> 00:41:24.750
Father.

00:41:24.750 --> 00:41:37.079
My son.

00:41:37.079 --> 00:41:40.079
Your son is destined to fail.

00:41:40.079 --> 00:41:44.079
Soon, a new age will dawn on earth,

00:41:44.079 --> 00:41:47.079
an age of power and strength,

00:41:47.079 --> 00:41:51.079
and fall of the house of El.

00:41:51.079 --> 00:41:54.539
Doomsday is coming.

00:41:54.539 --> 00:41:56.539
Day is coming.

